-The mouse-angle presets are not limited to 45-degree diagonals. Senpa's cursor writer uses integer coordinates, so a very small offset quantizes the exact angle. The offset can be adjusted in the same panel. Moving the mouse after the trigger does not change the captured direction during that finite macro.
